From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:28:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 021/260] [ae-patch] Restyle the merge card for phones with a
 segmented method control

On a card narrower than 30rem the Merge button, Confirm merge and Cancel span
the card, and Cancel becomes a quiet text button under Confirm. The merge
method is one segmented control (a radiogroup whose chosen segment is filled
and ticked with Tabler's check), so it no longer reads as two more action
buttons. Wider cards keep the buttons side by side. Behavior, test ids and
accessible names are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
